WEBVTT

00:08.931 --> 00:10.172
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.275 --> 00:11.965
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.068 --> 00:13.448
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:13.551 --> 00:15.310
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:15.413 --> 00:18.448
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.551 --> 00:20.517
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.620 --> 00:22.655
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:22.758 --> 00:24.586
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.689 --> 00:26.379
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:26.482 --> 00:28.551
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:28.655 --> 00:30.241
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.344 --> 00:32.586
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:32.689 --> 00:34.482
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:34.586 --> 00:36.482
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:36.586 --> 00:38.448
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:38.551 --> 00:40.344
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:40.448 --> 00:41.620
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.724 --> 00:43.931
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.034 --> 00:46.413
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.517 --> 00:48.655
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:48.758 --> 00:50.137
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.827 --> 00:55.758
[bright guitar music]
[明亮的吉他音乐]

00:55.862 --> 01:01.896
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:02.000 --> 01:04.448
- AND DID YOU WANT
KELP FRIES WITH THAT?
- 你想要吗
海带薯条配那个？

01:04.551 --> 01:08.172
- UH...
- 呃...

01:08.275 --> 01:09.206
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

01:09.310 --> 01:11.000
- SPONGEBOB, ORDER.
- 海绵宝宝，命令。

01:11.103 --> 01:12.000
OH.
哦。

01:13.241 --> 01:14.310
- [mumbling]
- [咕哝]

01:14.413 --> 01:15.896
ONE DOUBLE KRABBY PATTY,
EVERYTHING ON IT.
一份双层蟹肉饼，
上面有一切。

01:16.000 --> 01:16.896
ONE ORDER OF KELP FRIES.
一份海带薯条。

01:17.000 --> 01:18.620
ONE--
一 -

01:18.724 --> 01:21.034
SQUIDWARD, WHAT SIZE KELP FRIES
ARE THESE?
章鱼哥，海带薯条有多大
这些是吗？

01:21.137 --> 01:24.172
- UH...
- 呃...

01:24.275 --> 01:25.241
- MEDIUM.
- 中等的。

01:25.344 --> 01:27.068
- COMING RIGHT UP.
- 马上就来。

01:34.965 --> 01:37.827
[meat sizzling]
[肉滋滋作响]

01:46.620 --> 01:47.551
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:51.034 --> 01:53.758
- NOW THAT'S WHAT I CALL
FAST FOOD.
- 现在这就是我所说的
快餐。

01:53.862 --> 01:54.965
[door slams]
[关门声]

01:55.068 --> 01:56.586
- SQUIDWARD,
WHAT'S ALL THE HUBBARUB?
- 章鱼哥，
到底发生了什么？

01:57.931 --> 01:59.758
SPONGEBOB,
WHAT'S ALL THE HUBBARUB?
海绵宝宝，
到底发生了什么？

01:59.862 --> 02:02.206
- OH, I'M NOT SURE, MR. KRABS.
- 哦，我不确定，先生。螃蟹。

02:02.310 --> 02:03.724
I WAS BRINGING
THE CUSTOMER'S ORDER,
我带来了
客户的订单，

02:03.827 --> 02:06.310
AND THEN I SLIPPED AND FELL
IN THIS GREASE SLICK.
然后我滑倒了
在这光滑的油脂中。

02:06.413 --> 02:08.206
I THINK I MAY BE HURT REAL BAD.
我想我可能伤得很重。

02:08.310 --> 02:09.413
- GREASE SLICK, EH?
- 润滑脂光滑，嗯？

02:12.344 --> 02:13.517
- OH, WHAT IS IT?
- 哦，这是什么？

02:13.620 --> 02:17.206
- THAT, ME BOY,
IS A GREASE TRAP.
- 那，我男孩，
是一个隔油池。

02:17.310 --> 02:19.931
- IT KIND OF LOOKS LIKE NOBODY'S
CLEANED OUT THE TRAP IN A WHILE.
- 看起来有点像没有人的
一会儿就清理了陷阱。

02:20.034 --> 02:21.758
- YOU KNOW, SPONGEBOB,
YOU'RE RIGHT.
- 你知道，海绵宝宝，
你是对的。

02:21.862 --> 02:24.137
BUT THAT'S A BIG JOB,
但这是一项艰巨的工作，

02:24.241 --> 02:27.379
A JOB THAT ONLY TWO
VOLUNTEER EMPLOYEES
只有两个人的工作
志愿者员工

02:27.482 --> 02:30.103
COULD DO FOR NO EXTRA PAY.
无需额外付费即可完成。

02:32.551 --> 02:34.068
- YEAH!
- 是的！

02:37.586 --> 02:39.241
- HMM, NOTHING'S COMING OUT.
- 嗯，什么也没有发生。

02:39.344 --> 02:40.413
- MR. KRABS, MAY I SEE THAT?
- 先生。蟹蟹，我可以看一下吗？

02:40.517 --> 02:42.034
SAW THIS IN A MOVIE ONCE.
在电影里看过一次。

02:42.137 --> 02:45.000
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

02:49.448 --> 02:50.689
HMM.
唔。

02:50.793 --> 02:53.206
YEAH, MAYBE I WASN'T
DOING IT RIGHT.
是的，也许我不是
正确行事。

02:53.310 --> 02:54.413
OH, NEVER MIND.
哦，没关系。

02:54.517 --> 02:55.379
I WAS.
我是。

02:58.689 --> 03:01.103
YEAH, NOTHING LIKE A LONG NIGHT
OF SIPHONING GREASE
是的，没有什么比漫长的夜晚更好的了
虹吸油脂

03:01.206 --> 03:02.724
TO PUT SOME HAIRS ON YOUR CHEST,
EH, MR. KRABS?
把一些头发放在胸前，
呃，先生。螃蟹？

03:02.827 --> 03:04.206
- WHAT?
- 什么？

03:04.310 --> 03:06.482
- WELL, NOW THAT WE GOT THE OLD
GREASE TRAP CLEANED OUT,
- 好吧，现在我们已经旧了
油脂收集器已清理干净，

03:06.586 --> 03:08.482
WHAT DO YOU THINK WE SHOULD DO
WITH ALL THIS EXCESS GREASE?
你认为我们应该做什么
有这么多多余的油脂吗？

03:08.586 --> 03:11.034
- HMM.
- 唔。

03:11.137 --> 03:12.034
RIGHT BEHIND THERE.
就在后面。

03:12.137 --> 03:14.000
[truck beeping]
[卡车嘟嘟声]

03:15.172 --> 03:18.517
[wet sloshing]
[湿漉漉的晃动]

03:18.620 --> 03:20.931
ALL RIGHT,
LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.
好吧，
我们离开这里吧。

03:21.034 --> 03:24.344
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

03:24.448 --> 03:27.275
- MR. KRABS, ARE YOU SURE
THAT WAS LEGAL?
- 先生。蟹蟹，你确定吗？
那合法吗？

03:27.379 --> 03:28.379
- "LEGAL"?
- “合法的”？

03:28.482 --> 03:29.517
- YEAH, LEGAL.
- 是的，合法。

03:29.620 --> 03:30.896
- HMM.
- 唔。

03:35.068 --> 03:35.896
- [humming cheerfully]
- [欢快地哼唱]

03:36.000 --> 03:36.931
HUH?
嗯？

03:37.034 --> 03:37.896
OW!
噢！

03:38.000 --> 03:39.586
WHAT THE?
什么？

03:39.689 --> 03:41.862
THIS IS THE MOST BIZARRE
PRECIPITATION
这是最奇怪的
降水量

03:41.965 --> 03:43.517
I HAVE EVER SLIPPED
AND FALLEN IN.
我曾经滑倒过
并陷入了。

03:43.620 --> 03:44.482
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

03:44.586 --> 03:47.034
EW, IT REEKS.
嗯，很臭。

03:47.137 --> 03:50.689
BUT IT TASTES DELICIOUS!
但味道鲜美！

03:50.793 --> 03:53.344
DARN IT, I ALMOST HAD AN IDEA.
该死，我几乎有了一个主意。

03:53.448 --> 03:54.586
OH, I DO.
哦，我愿意。

03:54.689 --> 03:56.206
I DO HAVE AN IDEA.
我确实有一个主意。

03:56.310 --> 03:57.586
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

03:57.689 --> 03:58.724
- PLANKTON!
- 浮游生物！

03:58.827 --> 04:00.586
- COMING, DEAR.
- 来了，亲爱的。

04:03.413 --> 04:05.103
- SOMETHING IS TERRIBLY WRONG,
SQUIDWARD.
- 有什么事情是非常错误的，
章鱼哥。

04:05.206 --> 04:07.793
- AND IT'S TAKEN YOU THIS LONG
TO FIGURE THAT OUT?
- 你花了这么长时间
想弄清楚吗？

04:07.896 --> 04:10.862
- PLANKTON HAS HAD A LINE
OF CUSTOMERS ALL MORNING.
- 浮游生物有一条线
整个早上都有顾客。

04:10.965 --> 04:12.517
- SO?
- 所以？

04:12.620 --> 04:15.034
- SO I'M GONNA GO FIND OUT
WHAT THAT RASCAL'S UP TO.
-所以我要去找出答案
那个流氓在做什么。

04:15.137 --> 04:16.310
'SCUSE ME.
对不起。

04:16.413 --> 04:17.310
'SCUSE ME.
对不起。

04:17.413 --> 04:18.793
COMING THROUGH.
即将到来。

04:18.896 --> 04:19.965
WHAT THE?
什么？

04:21.448 --> 04:24.862
"TRY PLANKTON'S NEW DELICIOUS
CHUMMY PATTIES,
“尝试一下浮游生物的新美味
肉饼，

04:24.965 --> 04:27.413
NOW WITH EDIBLE FLAVOR"?
现在有食用味”？

04:27.517 --> 04:28.827
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

04:28.931 --> 04:32.517
CLEARLY SOMETHING CRABBY
IS GOING ON HERE.
显然有些暴躁的东西
正在这里进行。

04:32.620 --> 04:35.000
- NEXT CHUM-STOMER PLEASE.
- 请下一位密友。

04:36.344 --> 04:40.517
WELL, WELL, EUGENE KRABS.
好吧，好吧，尤金·克拉布斯。

04:40.620 --> 04:44.310
- SAVE THE FORMALITIES FOR YOUR
MOTHER-IN-LAW, PLANKTON.
- 为您省去手续
婆婆，浮游生物。

04:44.413 --> 04:45.827
YOU STOLE ME KRABBY PATTY
FORMULA,
你偷了我的蟹肉饼
公式，

04:45.931 --> 04:47.000
AND I WANT IT BACK.
我想要回来。

04:47.103 --> 04:49.310
- OH, SORRY TO DISAPPOINT,
KRABS.
- 哦，抱歉让您失望了，
螃蟹。

04:49.413 --> 04:51.448
BUT I'VE DONE NO SUCH THING.
但我没有做过这样的事。

04:51.551 --> 04:53.689
I'M SIMPLY USING A GIFT
SOMEBODY LEFT ME
我只是用一份礼物
有人离开了我

04:53.793 --> 04:55.827
TO MAKE MY CHUM TASTE GOOD.
让我的密友尝起来更美味。

04:55.931 --> 04:58.000
- A GIFT?
- 礼物？

04:58.103 --> 05:00.103
- IT'S ALMOST AS IF I HAD
A PERSONAL VISIT
- 就好像我有过一样
个人访问

05:00.206 --> 05:02.137
FROM THE FLAVOR FAIRY.
来自风味仙子。

05:02.241 --> 05:06.206
- BE THAT AS IT MAY, PLANKTON,
IT TAKES TWO TO TANGO.
- 无论如何，浮游生物，
探戈需要两个人。

05:06.310 --> 05:07.862
- WHAT?
- 什么？

05:07.965 --> 05:10.000
- SPONGEBOB,
STOP WHAT YOU'RE DOING.
- 海绵宝宝，
停止你正在做的事情。

05:10.103 --> 05:12.000
- BUT MR. KRABS,
I'M NOT DOING ANYTHING.
- 但是先生。螃蟹，
我什么也没做。

05:12.103 --> 05:13.034
- NEVER MIND THAT NOW.
- 现在别介意了。

05:13.137 --> 05:14.275
I GOT SOME NEW DIRECTION
FOR YOU.
我有了一些新的方向
为了您。

05:14.379 --> 05:15.931
NOW, FROM NOW ON,
现在，从现在开始，

05:16.034 --> 05:18.827
I WANT YOU TO FRY UP TWO PATTIES
FOR EVERY KRABBY PATTY WE SELL:
我要你煎两个肉饼
对于我们销售的每块蟹肉饼：

05:18.931 --> 05:20.517
ONE FOR THE PATTY ITSELF,
一份为肉饼本身，

05:20.620 --> 05:22.965
AND THE SECOND
JUST FOR THE GREASE.
第二个
只是为了润滑脂。

05:23.068 --> 05:25.344
THEN SLATHER THE GREASE
FROM THE SECOND PATTY
然后涂上油脂
来自第二个肉饼

05:25.448 --> 05:27.931
ONTO THE FIRST ONE, AND VOILA.
到第一个，瞧。

05:28.034 --> 05:32.793
IT'S A DELUXE KRABBY PATTY
WITH EXTRA FLAVOR.
这是豪华蟹肉饼
具有额外的风味。

05:32.896 --> 05:35.793
- MR. KRABS, DO YOU THINK
IT MIGHT BE KIND OF UNHEALTHY
- 先生。蟹蟹，你觉得
这可能有点不健康

05:35.896 --> 05:37.793
TO BE FEEDING PEOPLE
ALL THIS GREASE?
养活人民
所有这些油脂？

05:37.896 --> 05:39.310
- UNHEALTHY?
- 不健康？

05:39.413 --> 05:41.068
BOY, DIDN'T ANYONE
EVER TELL YOU?
男孩，没有人吗
曾经告诉过你吗？

05:41.172 --> 05:42.620
- TELL ME WHAT?
- 告诉我什么？

05:42.724 --> 05:46.655
- QUESTIONS ARE A DANGER TO YOU
AND A BURDEN TO OTHERS.
- 问题对你来说是危险的
以及对他人的负担。

05:48.275 --> 05:49.482
LITTLE LOWER.
低一点。

05:49.586 --> 05:50.482
LITTLE MORE.
再多一点。

05:50.586 --> 05:51.724
MORE, LITTLE MORE.
更多，更多一点。

05:51.827 --> 05:53.586
OKAY, A LITTLE TO THE LEFT NOW.
好的，现在向左一点。

05:53.689 --> 05:54.862
UP A BIT.
向上一点。

05:54.965 --> 05:55.965
OKAY, WAIT, THAT'S TOO FAR.
好吧，等等，那太远了。

05:56.068 --> 05:57.137
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT, PERFECT.
好吧，好吧，完美。

05:57.241 --> 05:58.586
RIGHT THERE.
就在那里。

05:58.689 --> 06:01.310
- MR. KRABS, I HOPE WHATEVER
YOU'RE YELLING ABOUT
- 先生。蟹蟹，我希望如此
你大喊大叫

06:01.413 --> 06:04.689
IS SOMETHING MORE IMPORTANT
THAN MY MID-MORNING NAP.
更重要的是
比我上午的小睡更重要。

06:04.793 --> 06:06.068
- JUST HANGING A NEW SIGN,
SQUIDWARD.
- 只是挂了一个新标牌，
章鱼哥。

06:09.241 --> 06:11.000
- JUST WHAT THE WORLD NEEDED.
- 正是世界所需要的。

06:11.103 --> 06:12.310
- SHH.
-嘘。

06:12.413 --> 06:14.000
OKAY, A LITTLE HIGHER NOW.
好的，现在高一点。

06:14.103 --> 06:15.034
- HEY, LOOK AT THAT.
- 嘿，看看那个。

06:15.137 --> 06:16.034
- WHAT?
- 什么？

06:16.137 --> 06:17.034
- THERE, RIGHT UP THERE.
- 那里，就在那里。

06:17.137 --> 06:18.068
- WHERE?
- 在哪里？

06:18.172 --> 06:19.034
I DON'T SEE ANYTHING.
我什么也没看到。

06:19.137 --> 06:20.172
- A LITTLE TO THE RIGHT.
- 向右一点。

06:20.275 --> 06:21.551
- OKAY, I SEE IT.
- 好吧，我明白了。

06:21.655 --> 06:24.551
- THERE'S A NEW SIGN UP
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
- 有一个新的注册
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅。

06:24.655 --> 06:26.000
IT SAYS THEY'RE SERVING
上面说他们正在服务

06:26.103 --> 06:29.241
SOMETHING CALLED
A DELUXE KRABBY PATTY.
叫做的东西
豪华蟹肉饼。

06:29.344 --> 06:30.793
- THAT SOUNDS DELICIOUS.
- 听起来很好吃。

06:30.896 --> 06:32.137
- YOU'RE TELLING ME.
- 你在告诉我。

06:32.241 --> 06:35.137
I'M GONNA TRY ONE.
我要尝试一个。

06:35.241 --> 06:38.000
- NEXT CHUM-STOMER IN LINE,
PLEASE.
- 下一个密友，
请。

06:39.172 --> 06:40.793
HELLO?
你好？

06:42.724 --> 06:44.793
- THESE ARE DELICIOUS.
- 这些很好吃。

06:44.896 --> 06:46.172
- YOU'RE RIGHT.
- 你说得对。

06:46.275 --> 06:48.931
I CAN'T IMAGINE WHAT MAKES THEM
TASTE SO GOOD.
我无法想象是什么造就了它们
味道很好。

06:49.034 --> 06:50.241
- WELL, WELL, WELL.
- 好吧，好吧，好吧。

06:50.344 --> 06:53.482
NOW I ACTUALLY DO SEE
WHAT KRABS MEANT
现在我确实看到了
蟹蟹的意思是什么

06:53.586 --> 06:55.448
WHEN HE SAID
TWO CAN PLAY THAT GAME.
当他说
两个人就可以玩这个游戏。

06:55.551 --> 06:57.586
BUT HE'S A BIGGER FOOL
THAN HE REALIZES
但他是个大傻瓜
比他意识到的

06:57.689 --> 06:58.965
IF HE THINKS OL' PLANKTON
如果他认为浮游生物

06:59.068 --> 07:01.034
IS GONNA TAKE THIS ONE
LYING DOWN.
我要拿这个
躺下。

07:01.137 --> 07:02.068
OH.
哦。

07:02.172 --> 07:03.000
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:04.172 --> 07:05.793
- MAN, AM I STUFFED.
- 伙计，我吃饱了吗？

07:05.896 --> 07:07.344
- ME TOO.
- 我也是。

07:07.448 --> 07:10.068
BUT THAT DELUXE KRABBY PATTY
WAS SO SWIMMING GOOD,
但是那个豪华蟹肉饼
游泳太好了，

07:10.172 --> 07:11.586
I'M GONNA GET ANOTHER ONE.
我要再买一件。

07:11.689 --> 07:12.724
- SOUNDS LIKE A PLAN.
- 听起来像是一个计划。

07:12.827 --> 07:13.724
- HOLD IT.
- 坚持住。

07:13.827 --> 07:14.965
WHAT'S THAT SIGN SAY?
那个标志说的是什么？

07:15.068 --> 07:16.068
- IT LOOKS LIKE IT SAYS,
- 看起来就像它说的，

07:16.172 --> 07:17.862
"NEW: ULTRA CHUMMY PATTIES
“新：超美味肉饼

07:17.965 --> 07:19.655
PACKED WITH QUADRUPLE GRILLED
GOODNESS."
包装有四重烧烤
天哪。”

07:23.620 --> 07:25.862
[fish chattering]
[鱼儿叽叽喳喳]

07:25.965 --> 07:27.758
- QUADRUPLE GOODNESS?
- 四重善良？

07:27.862 --> 07:29.517
WE'LL SEE ABOUT THAT.
我们将会看到这一点。

07:29.620 --> 07:31.931
KEEP THE GRILL GOING NONSTOP
让烧烤不停歇

07:32.034 --> 07:33.931
TO CRANK OUT AS MUCH GREASE
AS POSSIBLE.
尽可能多地排出油脂
尽可能。

07:34.034 --> 07:34.965
- WELL, OKAY, MR. KRABS.
- 好吧，先生。螃蟹。

07:35.068 --> 07:36.482
I NEVER TURN THE GRILL OFF,
我从不关掉烤架，

07:36.586 --> 07:38.344
BUT I CAN TURN IT OFF EVEN LESS
THAN THAT, IF YOU WANT.
但我甚至可以将其关闭
如果你愿意的话，还可以。

07:38.448 --> 07:41.034
- UH, I DON'T REALLY SEE WHAT--
- 呃，我真的不明白什么--

07:41.137 --> 07:42.034
WHOOP!
哎哟！

07:42.137 --> 07:43.620
MERMAID'S MOLLUSK.
美人鱼的软体动物。

07:43.724 --> 07:44.758
YAH.
啊。

07:44.862 --> 07:47.448
WHAT IN THE NAME OF NEPTUNE
IS THIS?
以海王星的名义做什么
这是吗？

07:47.551 --> 07:49.068
- SORRY, MR. KRABS.
- 对不起，先生。螃蟹。

07:49.172 --> 07:51.103
I ACCIDENTALLY DROPPED SOME BUNS
INTO OUR VAT OF EXTRA GREASE.
我不小心掉了一些面包
放入我们的额外油脂桶中。

07:51.206 --> 07:53.655
WELL, THEY'VE BEEN SOAKING
IN THERE FOR ABOUT AN HOUR.
好吧，他们一直在浸泡
在那里呆了大约一个小时。

07:58.034 --> 07:59.724
- YUMMY BUNZ, HUH?
- 美味的邦兹，嗯？

07:59.827 --> 08:01.172
WELL, YOU'RE GONNA HAVE TO TRY
好吧，你必须尝试一下

08:01.275 --> 08:03.034
A LITTLE HARDER THAN THAT,
KRABS,
比那难一点，
螃蟹，

08:03.137 --> 08:06.310
ONCE THE HUNGRY PUBLIC
HEARS ABOUT MY NEWEST CREATION.
一旦饥饿的公众
听说我的最新创作。

08:06.413 --> 08:07.931
- CREATION?
- 创造？

08:08.034 --> 08:11.068
MY SCANNER SHOWS THAT'S NOTHING
MORE THAN A BURNED GREASE CRUMB.
我的扫描仪显示什么都没有
不仅仅是烧焦的油脂屑。

08:11.172 --> 08:12.103
- YOU'RE RIGHT.
- 你说得对。

08:12.206 --> 08:14.241
AND IT'S PACKED WITH FLAVOR.
而且味道鲜美。

08:14.344 --> 08:16.655
crowd: CRISPITY CRUNCHITIES?
人群：脆脆的？

08:16.758 --> 08:17.620
- OH, WOW!
- 哦，哇！

08:17.724 --> 08:20.275
[all chattering]
[大家都在喋喋不休]

08:22.034 --> 08:24.275
- PEEYEW, MR. KRABS.
- 皮尤先生螃蟹。

08:24.379 --> 08:25.896
- HUH?
- 嗯？

08:26.000 --> 08:27.896
- DON'T YOU USUALLY FLUSH
THAT STUFF DOWN THE TOILET?
- 你平时不冲水吗
厕所里有那些东西？

08:28.000 --> 08:30.379
THIS IS OUR LATEST PRODUCT.
这是我们的最新产品。

08:30.482 --> 08:34.068
IT'S PURE GREASE
ON A PAPER PLATE.
这是纯油脂
在纸盘上。

08:34.172 --> 08:35.724
- I'LL GIVE YOU POINTS
FOR HONESTY.
- 我会给你积分
为了诚实。

08:40.482 --> 08:42.724
- SPONGEBOB, GET THOSE SEVEN
ORDERS OF WOW! SOUP
- 海绵宝宝，拿那七个
哇的订单！汤

08:42.827 --> 08:44.241
OUT TO TABLE THREE PRONTO.
很快就到了第三张桌子。

08:44.344 --> 08:45.931
WE GOT TO KEEP THESE
CUSTOMERS HAPPY,
我们必须保留这些
顾客高兴，

08:46.034 --> 08:47.827
OR PLANKTON
WILL STEAL THEM BACK.
或浮游生物
会把它们偷回来。

08:49.241 --> 08:51.103
[all moaning]
[全都呻吟]

08:51.206 --> 08:54.068
[squishing]
[压扁]

08:56.655 --> 08:58.241
- ARE YOU GOING TO EAT THAT?
- 你要吃那个吗？

08:58.344 --> 09:00.034
- IT WAS SUPPOSED TO BE GOING
TO TABLE THREE.
- 本来就应该这样
至表三。

09:00.137 --> 09:01.724
- OKAY.
- 好的。

09:02.931 --> 09:04.862
- SPONGEBOB!
- SIR, YES, SIR.
- 海绵宝宝！
- 先生，是的，先生。

09:04.965 --> 09:06.689
- ARE YOU GONNA SERVE
THAT SOUP TO TABLE THREE,
- 你要服务吗
三号桌的汤，

09:06.793 --> 09:07.965
OR ARE YOU GONNA WAIT
TILL IT GETS UP
还是你要等
直到它起来

09:08.068 --> 09:09.275
AND WALKS THERE ITSELF?
并亲自走到那里？

09:09.379 --> 09:11.000
- ACTUALLY, MR. KRABS,
I'VE BEEN THINKING.
- 事实上，先生。螃蟹，
我一直在想。

09:11.103 --> 09:13.310
AND, WELL, DON'T YOU THINK MAYBE
THIS WHOLE GREASE THING
而且，好吧，你不认为也许吗？
这整个油脂的事情

09:13.413 --> 09:14.551
HAS GONE A BIT TOO FAR?
是不是有点太过分了？

09:14.655 --> 09:15.724
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

09:15.827 --> 09:17.862
YOU KNOW WHAT I THINK,
SPONGEBOB?
你知道我的想法，
海绵宝宝？

09:17.965 --> 09:20.241
I THINK YOU SHOULD BE THINKING
ABOUT NOT THINKING
我认为你应该思考
关于不思考

09:20.344 --> 09:22.137
AND GET BACK TO WORK.
回到工作岗位。

09:22.241 --> 09:28.413
- GOT TO HAVE
CRUNCHITY MUNCHITY.
- 必须有
松脆的口感。

09:28.517 --> 09:29.551
- PATRICK!
- 帕特里克！

09:29.655 --> 09:30.586
OH, NO.
哦，不。

09:30.689 --> 09:33.482
NOT MY BEST FRIEND TOO.
也不是我最好的朋友。

09:39.034 --> 09:41.931
[deep breathing]
[深呼吸]

09:44.620 --> 09:46.068
- [squeals]
OH, NO.
- [尖叫声]
哦，不。

09:46.172 --> 09:47.482
DID SOMEBODY CALL
THE HEALTH INSPECTOR?
有人打电话吗
卫生检查员？

09:47.586 --> 09:48.827
- OH, NO.
- 哦，不。

09:48.931 --> 09:51.068
DID SOMEBODY CALL
THE HEALTH INSPECTOR?
有人打电话吗
卫生检查员？

09:51.172 --> 09:54.379
- DID SOMEBODY CALL
A HEALTH INSPECTOR?
- 有人打电话吗
健康检查员？

09:54.482 --> 09:55.655
- IT WAS ME, SIR.
- 是我，先生。

09:55.758 --> 09:58.000
I JUST WANTED
TO TELL YOU THAT, WELL,
我只是想要
告诉你，好吧，

09:58.103 --> 10:01.724
FOR THE PAST TWO WEEKS PLANKTON
AND MR. KRABS HAVE BEEN--
过去两周浮游生物
还有先生。螃蟹已经——

10:01.827 --> 10:02.896
THEY'VE BEEN FEEDING PEOPLE--
他们一直在养活人们——

10:03.000 --> 10:04.206
[muffled speech]
[低声说话]

10:04.310 --> 10:05.413
THEY'VE BEEN FEEDING PEOPLE--
他们一直在养活人们——

10:05.517 --> 10:06.586
THEY'VE BEEN FEEDING PEOPLE--
他们一直在养活人们——

10:06.689 --> 10:07.724
[crashing]
[崩溃]

10:07.827 --> 10:09.413
- WHAT'S GOING ON HERE?
- 这是怎么回事？

10:09.517 --> 10:10.517
- [nervous laugh]
- [紧张的笑声]

10:10.620 --> 10:12.172
NOTHING, MR. INSPECTOR.
没什么，先生。检查员。

10:12.275 --> 10:14.689
- THEY'VE BEEN FEEDING PEOPLE--
-他们一直在喂人--

10:14.793 --> 10:18.896
- JUST A FRIENDLY COMPETITION
BETWEEN OLD...
- 只是一场友谊赛
旧之间...

10:19.000 --> 10:21.517
- F-F-F
-F-F-F
-F-F-F
-F-F-F
-F-F-F
-F-F-F
-F-F-F
-F-F-F

10:21.620 --> 10:23.413
- F-F-F--
FRIENDS?
- F-F-F--
朋友？

10:23.517 --> 10:25.000
- FRIENDS, RIGHT.
- 朋友们，对了。

10:25.103 --> 10:25.965
[crashing]
[崩溃]

10:26.068 --> 10:29.551
- THEY'RE FEEDING PEOPLE GREASE.
- 他们正在给人们喂油脂。

10:29.655 --> 10:34.034
- WELL, I THOUGHT I RECOGNIZED
THIS HORRIBLE STENCH.
- 嗯，我以为我认出了
这可怕的恶臭。

10:34.137 --> 10:35.724
BUT I THOUGHT MAYBE
ONE OF YOU TWO
但我想也许
你们两个之一

10:35.827 --> 10:37.517
HADN'T SHOWERED IN A WHILE.
有一段时间没洗澡了。

10:37.620 --> 10:42.413
- OFFICER, OFFICER, I WOULD JUST
LIKE TO STATE FOR THE RECORD
- 官员，官员，我只想
谨此声明以供记录

10:42.517 --> 10:45.068
THAT THIS WAS ALL HIS IDEA,
ALL OF IT.
这都是他的主意，
所有这一切。

10:45.172 --> 10:46.413
- OH, REALLY?
- 哦真的吗？

10:46.517 --> 10:48.379
WELL, IN THAT CASE,
YOU'LL BE HAPPY TO KNOW
那么，在这种情况下，
您会很高兴知道

10:48.482 --> 10:50.620
I'LL BE ORDERING
BOTH YOUR RESTAURANTS
我要订购
您的两家餐厅

10:50.724 --> 10:52.137
TO BE CLOSED DOWN
即将关闭

10:52.241 --> 10:55.827
UNTIL THE TWO OF YOU SLIMEBALLS
CAN CLEAN UP YOUR ACT.
直到你们两个变成粘球
可以净化你的行为。

10:55.931 --> 10:56.896
GOOD DAY.
再会。

10:57.000 --> 10:57.862
[door slams]
[关门声]

10:57.965 --> 10:59.586
[engine revving]
[发动机转速]

11:01.000 --> 11:02.758
- WELL, I'M TAKING A BATH.
- 嗯，我正在洗澡。

11:02.862 --> 11:05.965
- I GUESS THIS IS IT, BOY:
THE END OF AN ERA.
- 我想就是这样了，男孩：
一个时代的结束。

11:06.068 --> 11:08.344
- NO, IT'S NOT THE END,
MR. KRABS.
- 不，这不是结束，
先生。螃蟹。

11:08.448 --> 11:12.620
- IT IS, UNLESS I CAN FIND A WAY
TO GET THIS GREASE SOAKED UP.
- 是的，除非我能找到办法
吸收油脂。

11:12.724 --> 11:14.517
- WAIT A MINUTE.
- 等一下。

11:14.620 --> 11:16.241
DID YOU SAY SOAKED UP?
你说浸泡了吗？

11:16.344 --> 11:18.241
- OH, WHAT DIFFERENCE
DOES IT MAKE?
- 哦，有什么不同
它能做到吗？

11:18.344 --> 11:19.206
- YOU'LL SEE.
- 你会看到的。

11:21.448 --> 11:24.724
- [snoring and mumbling]
- [打鼾和咕哝]

11:24.827 --> 11:25.793
HUH?
嗯？

11:25.896 --> 11:28.896
OH, IT WAS ALL A DREAM.
哦，这只是一个梦。

11:29.000 --> 11:30.862
- NO, IT WASN'T, MR. KRABS.
- 不，不是的，先生。螃蟹。

11:30.965 --> 11:33.206
I SOAKED UP ALL
THE OFFENDING SUBSTANCES
我吸收了一切
有害物质

11:33.310 --> 11:34.448
FROM THE SURROUNDING AREA,
从周边地区来看，

11:34.551 --> 11:36.931
AND I'M GONNA GO
DISPOSE OF THEM PROPERLY.
我要走了
正确处置它们。

11:37.034 --> 11:39.448
THE KRUSTY KRAB IS GREASE FREE.
脆皮蟹不含油脂。

11:39.551 --> 11:40.689
- [excited moaning]
- [兴奋的呻吟声]

11:40.793 --> 11:41.862
- PATRICK, NO.
- 帕特里克，不。

11:41.965 --> 11:43.655
- [excited moaning]
- [兴奋的呻吟声]

11:43.758 --> 11:45.620
CRUNCHITY MUNCHITIES.
脆脆的零食。

11:45.724 --> 11:46.586
- STOP IT.
- 停下来。

11:46.689 --> 11:47.586
STOP IT.
停下来。

11:47.689 --> 11:48.586
GO AWAY.
离开。

11:48.689 --> 11:50.172
NO, NO!
不，不！

11:53.413 --> 11:56.310
[bright guitar music]
[明亮的吉他音乐]

11:56.413 --> 12:02.068
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:03.896 --> 12:05.379
- YOU'RE NOTHING.
- 你什么都不是。

12:05.482 --> 12:07.172
IS ALL THAT GRIME MEANT
TO SCARE ME,
这就是污垢的意思吗
为了吓唬我，

12:07.275 --> 12:09.655
MR. MIRROR?
先生。镜子？

12:09.758 --> 12:12.896
I'VE MET SARDINES
TOUGHER THAN YOU ARE.
我见过沙丁鱼
比你更坚强。

12:13.000 --> 12:16.206
TIME TO PUT YOU IN YOUR PLACE.
是时候让你就位了。

12:24.000 --> 12:25.413
LOOKING GOOD, MIRROR.
看起来不错，镜子。

12:25.517 --> 12:27.310
SORRY ABOUT THE HARSH WORDS.
对于严厉的言语，我们深表歉意。

12:27.413 --> 12:29.172
NOW TO ATTACK THESE FLOORS.
现在攻击这些楼层。

12:29.275 --> 12:30.310
- [chuckling]
- [轻笑]

12:30.413 --> 12:32.000
ARE YOU KIDDING?
你在开玩笑吧？

12:32.103 --> 12:34.482
HE'S AN ABSOLUTELY TREASURE
TO HAVE AROUND THE RESTAURANT.
他绝对是一个宝藏
到餐厅周围去。

12:34.586 --> 12:36.793
- OH, SOUNDS LIKE MR. KRABS
IS BRAGGING ABOUT ME
- 哦，听起来像先生。蟹蟹
正在吹嘘我

12:36.896 --> 12:38.275
AGAIN TO HIS ASSOCIATES.
再说他的同事。

12:38.379 --> 12:40.482
- AND HE'S BEEN WITH ME
FOR SUCH A LONG TIME NOW.
- 他一直和我在一起
这么长时间了。

12:40.586 --> 12:42.275
- I HAVE.
- 我有。

12:42.379 --> 12:45.551
- BUT I'M AFRAID I'M GONNA HAVE
TO LET THE LITTLE GUY GO TODAY.
- 但我担心我会拥有
今天就让这个小家伙走吧。

12:45.655 --> 12:46.482
- YEP, HE'S GONNA HAVE TO--
- 是的，他必须--

12:46.586 --> 12:47.482
WHAT?
什么？

12:47.586 --> 12:48.862
"LET THE LITTLE GUY GO"?
“放开小家伙”？

12:48.965 --> 12:50.068
LITTLE GUY,
WHO'S THE LITTLE GUY?
小家伙，
谁是小家伙？

12:50.172 --> 12:52.413
IT MUST BE EITHER ME OR--
要么是我，要么——

12:52.517 --> 12:53.448
[gasps]
[喘气]

12:53.551 --> 12:54.862
SQUIDWARD.
章鱼哥。

12:56.068 --> 12:57.551
OOH, I AM TALLER.
哦，我更高了。

12:57.655 --> 12:59.275
YOU'RE THE LITTLE GUY, SQUIDSY.
你是小家伙，鱿鱼。

12:59.379 --> 13:00.655
- NO.
- 不。

13:00.758 --> 13:02.689
AND I WANT YOU TO STOP
CALLING ME SQUIDSY.
我希望你停下来
叫我鱿鱼。

13:02.793 --> 13:04.827
- OH, SQUIDWARD LOOKED TALLER
THERE FOR A SECOND.
-哦，章鱼哥看起来更高了
就这样。

13:04.931 --> 13:06.275
BETTER GET A MORE
ACCURATE MEASUREMENT.
更好地获得更多
准确的测量。

13:08.344 --> 13:09.724
- WHAT DO YOU THINK
YOU'RE DOING?
- 你觉得怎么样
你在做什么？

13:09.827 --> 13:13.551
- OH, JUST SEEING WHICH
ONE OF US IS THE LITTLE GUY.
- 哦，只是看看哪个
我们中的一个是小家伙。

13:13.655 --> 13:15.103
AND IT LOOKS LIKE IT IS YOU.
看起来就是你。

13:15.206 --> 13:16.379
- NO, I'M NOT.
- 不，我不是。

13:16.482 --> 13:17.896
- SQUIDWARD, WAIT.
- 章鱼哥，等等。

13:18.000 --> 13:20.413
WE HAVEN'T MEASURED WITH MY LEGS
AT FULL EXTENSION YET.
我们还没有用腿测量
尚未全面展开。

13:20.517 --> 13:21.931
- I DON'T CARE.
- 我不在乎。

13:22.034 --> 13:23.103
NOW GET BACK IN THE KITCHEN.
现在回到厨房。

13:23.206 --> 13:24.344
- YOU'LL CARE
WHEN YOU FIND OUT
- 你会关心的
当您发现时

13:24.448 --> 13:26.068
WHAT'S GONNA HAPPEN
TO THE LITTLE GUY.
将会发生什么
给小家伙。

13:26.172 --> 13:27.275
WHOA!
哇啊！

13:27.379 --> 13:29.275
OH, WHO AM I KIDDING?
哦，我在开玩笑吗？

13:29.379 --> 13:31.034
I NEED TO FACE THE FACTS,
我需要面对事实，

13:31.137 --> 13:33.724
FACE THE FACT
THAT I'M THE LITTLE GUY,
面对事实
我是小家伙，

13:33.827 --> 13:36.379
AND THAT MR. KRABS
IS LETTING ME GO TODAY.
还有那个先生。蟹蟹
今天让我走了。

13:36.482 --> 13:38.379
- KRABS IS LETTING YOU GO TODAY?
- 螃蟹今天要放你走吗？

13:38.482 --> 13:39.965
[laughing]
[笑]

13:40.068 --> 13:42.758
AS IN, I WON'T HAVE TO
WORK WITH YOU EVER AGAIN?
如，我不必
再次与您合作吗？

13:42.862 --> 13:43.758
[laughs]
[笑]

13:46.758 --> 13:48.413
- GOOD-BYE, KRUSTY KRAB.
- 再见，蟹堡王。

13:48.517 --> 13:50.344
GOOD-BYE, LIFE AS I KNOW IT.
再见，我所知道的生活。

13:50.448 --> 13:53.103
[wind howling]
[风呼啸]

13:53.206 --> 13:55.344
- YEAH, AS MUCH AS I DON'T LIKE
DOING IT,
- 是的，尽管我不喜欢
这样做，

13:55.448 --> 13:56.758
I HAVE TO LET HIM GO.
我必须让他走。

13:56.862 --> 13:58.620
GOTTEN TOO BIG FOR HIS CAGE.
对于他的笼子来说太大了。

14:00.379 --> 14:01.517
GO ON, LITTLE GUY.
继续吧，小家伙。

14:01.620 --> 14:02.793
FLY AWAY.
飞走吧。

14:02.896 --> 14:03.862
YOU'LL BE MISSED.
我们会想念您的。

14:03.965 --> 14:06.827
- [chirping]
- [叽叽喳喳]

14:11.379 --> 14:14.344
- [mewling]
- [呜咽]

14:14.448 --> 14:16.689
- OH, WHAT'S THE USE, GARY?
- 哦，有什么用，加里？

14:16.793 --> 14:18.586
I'VE LOST THE WILL TO GO ON.
我已经失去了继续下去的意愿。

14:18.689 --> 14:20.689
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

14:20.793 --> 14:23.758
I DON'T FEEL LIKE GOING ON!
我不想继续了！

14:25.758 --> 14:27.241
HI, PATRICK.
嗨，帕特里克。

14:27.344 --> 14:31.103
- OH, SORRY TO INTERRUPT YOUR
FIT OF SELF-LOATHING, SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，抱歉打扰你了
海绵宝宝，自我厌恶。

14:31.206 --> 14:33.517
I'M JUST BORROWING YOUR
REFRIGERATOR AGAIN.
我只是借用你的
再次冰箱。

14:33.620 --> 14:34.586
- WHAT HAPPENED TO YOURS?
- 你的怎么了？

14:34.689 --> 14:36.448
- NOTHING; IT'S JUST EMPTY.
- 没有什么;它只是空的。

14:36.551 --> 14:38.862
- OH, GET IT OUT OF MY SIGHT.
- 哦，让它离开我的视线。

14:38.965 --> 14:41.724
NOW THAT I HAVE NO MEANS
OF PURCHASING FOOD FOR MYSELF,
现在我已经没有办法了
为自己购买食物，

14:41.827 --> 14:43.793
I DO NOT NEED A REFRIGERATOR.
我不需要冰箱。

14:43.896 --> 14:46.241
- DON'T GET DOWN ON YOURSELF,
BUDDY.
- 不要对自己感到沮丧，
伙计。

14:46.344 --> 14:48.517
YOU CAN STILL PURCHASE FOOD
FOR ME.
您仍然可以购买食物
为了我。

14:48.620 --> 14:50.413
- OH, NO, I CAN'T, PATRICK.
- 哦，不，我不能，帕特里克。

14:50.517 --> 14:52.034
I LOST MY JOB TODAY.
我今天失业了。

14:52.137 --> 14:54.310
I WON'T BE ABLE TO BUY FOOD
FOR YOU
我买不到食物
为您服务

14:54.413 --> 14:57.137
OR FOR GARY OR FOR ANYBODY.
或为加里或为任何人。

14:57.241 --> 14:58.206
- OH, NO!
- 哦，不！

14:58.310 --> 14:59.724
WHAT ARE YOU GONNA DO?
你要做什么？

14:59.827 --> 15:01.379
- I DON'T KNOW, I DON'T KNOW,
I DON'T KNOW!
- 我不知道，我不知道，
我不知道！

15:01.482 --> 15:03.586
I'VE BEEN A FRY COOK
FOR SO LONG.
我曾经是一名炒菜厨师
这么久了。

15:03.689 --> 15:06.310
I DON'T THINK I CAN DO
ANYTHING ELSE.
我认为我做不到
还有什么。

15:06.413 --> 15:07.931
- I KNOW, SPONGEBOB.
- 我知道，海绵宝宝。

15:08.034 --> 15:10.931
JUST DO WHAT I DO
WHEN I'M LOOKING FOR A JOB.
做我做的事
当我找工作时。

15:11.034 --> 15:12.172
KICK BACK.
踢回来。

15:12.275 --> 15:15.379
WATCH SOME TV,
AND CHUG DOWN A CARTON
看一些电视，
然后抓起一个纸箱

15:15.482 --> 15:17.103
OF DRINKABLE SAUSAGE.
饮用香肠。

15:17.206 --> 15:18.275
[sipping]
[啜饮]

15:18.379 --> 15:19.827
- [meows]
- [喵]

15:19.931 --> 15:21.379
- GOOD, GARY.
- 好，加里。

15:21.482 --> 15:24.000
THERE HAVE TO BE SOME JOB
OPENINGS IN THE CLASSIFIEDS.
必须有一些工作
机密信息中的空缺。

15:24.103 --> 15:25.034
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

15:25.137 --> 15:26.448
BOO!
嘘！

15:26.551 --> 15:29.172
ALTHOUGH THESE ADS SMELL
A LITTLE OUT OF DATE.
尽管这些广告闻起来很臭
有点过时了。

15:29.275 --> 15:31.103
I BETTER GET SOME FRESH ONES.
我最好买一些新鲜的。

15:31.206 --> 15:33.172
LAWYER, NO, TOO MUCH ARGUING.
律师，不，争论太多了。

15:33.275 --> 15:35.586
STUNT DRIVER, DON'T HAVE
A BOATING LICENSE.
特技车手，没有
划船许可证。

15:35.689 --> 15:38.068
ASTRONAUT,
DON'T LIKE FOOD IN A BAG.
宇航员，
不喜欢袋子里的食物。

15:38.172 --> 15:39.413
OH, THIS ONE SOUNDS INTERESTING.
哦，这听起来很有趣。

15:39.517 --> 15:41.137
"BANK TELLER NEEDED."
“需要银行出纳员。”

15:41.241 --> 15:43.344
THAT SHOULDN'T BE TOO MUCH
OF A STRETCH FROM FRY COOKING.
这不应该太多
油炸烹饪的延伸。

15:44.793 --> 15:46.172
20, 40, 60, 80, 90
20、40、60、80、90
20、40、60、80、90
20、40、60、80、90
20、40、60、80、90
20、40、60、80、90
20、40、60、80、90
20、40、60、80、90

15:46.275 --> 15:47.931
95, 96, 97.
95、96、97。
95、96、97。
95、96、97。
95、96、97。
95、96、97。
95、96、97。
95、96、97。

15:51.275 --> 15:52.793
ORDER UP.
订购。

16:02.793 --> 16:03.896
WHAT DO YOU THINK, BOSS?
老板，你觉得怎么样？

16:04.000 --> 16:06.448
- CLAMSHELLS.
- 蛤壳。

16:06.551 --> 16:07.896
WHAT HAVE YOU DONE, BOY?
孩子，你做了什么？

16:08.000 --> 16:09.793
I TOLD YOU
TO BUILD ME A HOUSE,
我告诉过你
为我建造一座房子，

16:09.896 --> 16:11.344
NOT A SANDWICH.
不是三明治。

16:12.482 --> 16:13.655
both: OH!
两人：哦！

16:13.758 --> 16:15.862
- I GUESS I'M NOT A CARPENTER,
PATRICK.
- 我想我不是木匠，
帕特里克。

16:18.586 --> 16:24.137
I NEED TO START FRESH WITH A JOB
THAT FEELS NATURAL,
我需要重新开始工作
感觉很自然，

16:24.241 --> 16:28.344
SOMETHING THAT SAYS,
"THIS IS A JOB FOR A SPONGE."
有句话说，
“这是海绵的工作。”

16:28.448 --> 16:30.206
ANY IDEA WHERE I CAN FIND
A JOB LIKE THAT, PATRICK?
我可以在哪里找到任何想法
像这样的工作吗，帕特里克？

16:30.310 --> 16:31.862
- NOPE.
- 没有。

16:31.965 --> 16:33.000
OH, BUT YES!
哦，但是是的！

16:33.103 --> 16:34.379
IT'S SO OBVIOUS.
这太明显了。

16:34.482 --> 16:36.068
YOU SHOULD WORK
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB.
你应该工作
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅。

16:36.172 --> 16:37.379
THEY NEED A FRY COOK.
他们需要一名炒菜厨师。

16:37.482 --> 16:38.448
- I CAN'T, PATRICK.
- 我不能，帕特里克。

16:38.551 --> 16:39.724
THAT'S THE JOB I GOT FIRED FROM.
这就是我被解雇的工作。

16:39.827 --> 16:40.758
REMEMBER?
记住？

16:40.862 --> 16:42.137
- OH.
- 哦。

16:42.241 --> 16:45.379
MAYHAPS YOU SHOULD TALK
TO THE SPONGE BEHIND YOU.
也许你应该谈谈
到你身后的海绵。

16:45.482 --> 16:46.724
HE LOOKS HAPPY.
他看起来很高兴。

16:46.827 --> 16:48.551
- THAT'S JUST A BILLBOARD,
PATRICK.
- 这只是一个广告牌，
帕特里克。

16:48.655 --> 16:51.448
- WHY DON'T YOU GET A JOB
AS A BILLBOARD?
- 你为什么不去找工作
作为广告牌？

16:51.551 --> 16:53.862
- I DON'T THINK
THAT'S PHYSICALLY POSSIBLE.
- 我不认为
这在物理上是可能的。

16:53.965 --> 16:57.517
BUT I COULD AUDITION
TO BE A SPONGE MODEL.
但我可以试镜
成为海绵模特。

16:57.620 --> 16:58.896
- FINE, DO IT YOUR WAY.
- 好吧，按你的方式去做。

17:01.862 --> 17:03.344
- WOW.
- 哇。

17:03.448 --> 17:05.310
WHAT A SETUP.
真是一个设置。

17:05.413 --> 17:06.551
I DON'T KNOW, PATRICK.
我不知道，帕特里克。

17:06.655 --> 17:08.620
MAYBE THIS WAS A MISTAKE.
也许这是一个错误。

17:08.724 --> 17:10.620
MAYBE I DON'T HAVE THE TALENT.
也许我没有这个天赋。

17:10.724 --> 17:12.793
- OH, YOU HAVE THE TALENT.
- 哦，你有才华。

17:12.896 --> 17:15.689
BUT DO YOU HAVE
THE NATURAL ABILITY?
但你有吗
天生的能力？

17:15.793 --> 17:16.655
- YEAH, BUT--
- 是的，但是--

17:16.758 --> 17:18.034
WAIT, ISN'T THAT THE SAME THING?
等等，这不是同一件事吗？

17:18.137 --> 17:20.000
- WHY DON'T YOU FIND OUT?
- WAIT!
- 你为什么不知道？
- 等待！

17:20.103 --> 17:21.758
I CAN'T DO THIS, PATRICK.
我不能这样做，帕特里克。

17:21.862 --> 17:23.620
WHAT IF I DON'T STACK UP
TO THE COMPETITION?
如果我不堆叠怎么办
参加比赛？

17:23.724 --> 17:26.034
MAYBE I SHOULD JUST BEG
MR. KRABS FOR MY OLD JOB BACK.
也许我应该乞求
先生。螃蟹让我回到原来的工作岗位。

17:26.137 --> 17:27.275
- NO WAY.
- 决不。

17:27.379 --> 17:28.586
IT'S TOO LATE FOR THAT NOW.
现在已经太晚了。

17:28.689 --> 17:30.517
KRABS DOESN'T NEED YOU ANYMORE.
蟹蟹不再需要你了。

17:30.620 --> 17:33.724
THIS IS YOUR CHANCE
TO PROVE YOU DON'T NEED HIM.
这是你的机会
证明你不需要他。

17:33.827 --> 17:36.827
NOW GET IN THERE
AND EARN ME SOME GROCERIES.
现在进入那里
并为我赚一些杂货。

17:38.413 --> 17:42.724
MY FRIEND HERE WANTS TO AUDITION
FOR THE SPONGE MODEL ROLE.
我的朋友想参加试镜
对于海绵模型的角色。

17:42.827 --> 17:45.137
- WELL, WELL,
"WANT" IS A STRONG WORD.
- 好吧，好吧，
“想要”是一个很强烈的词。

17:45.241 --> 17:46.689
I'D LIKE AN AUDITION,
我想要试镜，

17:46.793 --> 17:48.241
BUT IF YOU'VE ALREADY CAST IT,
THAT'S FINE.
但如果你已经投了，
没关系。

17:48.344 --> 17:49.758
HAVE YOU CAST IT?
I THINK SHE'S ALREADY CAST IT.
你投了吗？
我想她已经选好了。

17:49.862 --> 17:50.965
WE BETTER GO, PATRICK.
- HOLD IT.
我们最好走了，帕特里克。
- 坚持住。

17:51.068 --> 17:52.379
YOU WANT THE AUDITION, KID?
你想要试镜吗，孩子？

17:52.482 --> 17:54.172
YOU GOT IT.
- I DID?
你明白了。
- 我做到了？

17:54.275 --> 17:56.034
- SHOW ME WHAT YOU GOT.
- 让我看看你得到了什么。

17:56.137 --> 17:57.689
- OKAY, HERE GOES.
- 好的，开始了。

17:57.793 --> 17:59.379
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

17:59.482 --> 18:00.448
PATRICK, PLEASE?
帕特里克，有请吗？

18:00.551 --> 18:01.724
ding!
叮！

18:01.827 --> 18:03.620
[high-pitched singing]
[高亢的歌声]

18:03.724 --> 18:04.655
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

18:04.758 --> 18:05.655
SORRY.
对不起。

18:05.758 --> 18:06.620
[high-pitched singing]
[高亢的歌声]

18:06.724 --> 18:08.241
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

18:08.344 --> 18:12.275
[singing]
[歌唱]

18:12.379 --> 18:13.758
- OKAY, OKAY, OKAY.
- 好吧，好吧，好吧。

18:13.862 --> 18:15.172
LET'S GET ON
WITH THIS TRAIN WRECK.
让我们继续吧
与这列火车残骸。

18:15.275 --> 18:16.827
- OKAY, GETTING ON IT.
- 好的，开始吧。

18:16.931 --> 18:18.551
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

18:18.655 --> 18:21.793
♪ WHEN YOU DREAM UPON A WISH
♪ 当你梦想成真时

18:21.896 --> 18:24.241
♪ YOU'LL BE HEARTENED TO KNOW
♪ 你会很高兴知道

18:24.344 --> 18:30.344
♪ THAT HOPE FILLS YOUR DISH
TO THE BRIM ♪
♪ 这希望填满你的盘子
到了边缘♪

18:30.448 --> 18:32.000
- ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT,
THANK YOU.
- 好吧，好吧，
谢谢。

18:32.103 --> 18:32.965
I'VE HEARD ENOUGH.
我已经听够了。

18:33.068 --> 18:34.068
- HOW'D I DO?
- 我怎么样？

18:34.172 --> 18:35.275
- HORRIBLY.
- 太可怕了。

18:35.379 --> 18:38.586
I'VE SEEN CLAMS WITH MORE TALENT
THAN YOU.
我见过更有天赋的蛤蜊
比你。

18:38.689 --> 18:41.448
BUT SINCE THE ROLE SPECIFICALLY
CALLS FOR A REAL SPONGE,
但自从这个角色具体
需要真正的海绵，

18:41.551 --> 18:43.827
THE PART IS YOURS.
这部分是你的了。

18:43.931 --> 18:44.931
HERE'S THE SCRIPT.
这是脚本。

18:45.034 --> 18:46.517
WE START SHOOTING TOMORROW
AT 10:00.
我们明天开始拍摄
10:00。

18:46.620 --> 18:47.482
DON'T BE LATE.
不要迟到。

18:49.862 --> 18:52.379
- I GUESS A SPONGE
CAN MAKE IT IN THIS TOWN.
- 我猜是海绵
能在这个小镇成功。

18:52.482 --> 18:54.344
I AM GONNA BE A STAR!
我要成为明星！

18:54.448 --> 18:56.896
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

18:59.448 --> 19:01.689
- I'M STANDING HERE
WITH THE NEW FACE OF TELEVISION,
- 我站在这里
随着电视的新面貌，

19:01.793 --> 19:03.758
MR. SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS.
先生。海绵宝宝。

19:03.862 --> 19:06.620
I'M SURE THE VIEWING AUDIENCE
WOULD LOVE TO KNOW,
我确信观众
我很想知道，

19:06.724 --> 19:09.034
HOW DOES IT FEEL TO BE
THE NEXT BIG THING?
感觉如何
下一件大事？

19:09.137 --> 19:11.448
- FANTASTIC.
- 极好的。

19:11.551 --> 19:13.931
all: SPONGEBOB, SPONGEBOB!
所有人：海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝！

19:14.034 --> 19:16.172
SPONGEBOB, SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝！

19:16.275 --> 19:18.517
SPONGEBOB, SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝，海绵宝宝！

19:18.620 --> 19:20.172
- SPONGEBOB.
- 海绵宝宝。

19:20.275 --> 19:22.379
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
YOU SAY SOMETHING?
嘿，海绵宝宝，
你说点什么吗？

19:22.482 --> 19:23.896
- OH, YES, I DID, PATRICK.
- 哦，是的，我做到了，帕特里克。

19:24.000 --> 19:26.103
I SAID, "YOU'RE LOOKING
AT THE NEW FACE OF TELEVISION."
我说：“你在看
电视的新面孔。”

19:26.206 --> 19:27.551
- ALL RIGHT.
- 好的。

19:27.655 --> 19:29.379
- WELL, BETTER GO HOME
AND GET SOME BEAUTY SLEEP.
- 好吧，最好回家了
睡一觉美容觉。

19:29.482 --> 19:31.724
- YEAH, BEAUTY SLEEP!
- 是的，睡美容觉！

19:31.827 --> 19:33.068
- THAT'S RIGHT.
- 这是正确的。

19:33.172 --> 19:35.000
YOU ARE LOOKING
AT A CHANGED SPONGE.
你正在寻找
换了海绵。

19:35.103 --> 19:36.068
BUT DON'T WORRY.
但别担心。

19:36.172 --> 19:37.241
I WON'T FORGET ALL THE PEOPLE
我不会忘记所有的人

19:37.344 --> 19:38.103
WHO HELPED ME
ON THE WAY UP.
谁帮助了我
正在上升。

19:38.206 --> 19:39.344
- AFTERNOON, BOY-O.
- 下午，男孩。

19:39.448 --> 19:40.896
- OH, JUST AS I WAS SAYING.
- 哦，正如我所说。

19:41.000 --> 19:42.965
I'D LIKE TO THANK YOU
FOR GIVING ME MY HUMBLE START.
我想谢谢你
感谢给了我卑微的开始。

19:43.068 --> 19:45.172
I WON'T FORGET YOU.
我不会忘记你。

19:45.275 --> 19:46.965
- WHAT WAS THAT ABOUT?
- 那是关于什么的？

19:47.068 --> 19:49.758
OH, PROBABLY JUST NONSENSE
AND BABBLING, AS USUAL.
哦，可能只是废话
和往常一样胡言乱语。

19:51.482 --> 19:54.551
- PATRICK, WHEN NEXT YOU SEE ME,
IT SHALL BE ON THE TELEVISION.
- 帕特里克，当你下次看到我时，
它将在电视上播出。

20:00.275 --> 20:01.896
- OH, YOU'RE BACK.
- 哦，你回来了。

20:02.000 --> 20:04.068
- A STAR'S FIRST DAY
IS HIS MOST IMPORTANT.
- 明星的第一天
是他最重要的。

20:04.172 --> 20:06.103
- GREAT, LET ME SEE
IF THEY'RE READY ON SET.
- 太好了，让我看看
如果他们准备好了。

20:06.206 --> 20:07.103
SPONGEBOB'S HERE, SIR.
海绵宝宝在这里，先生。

20:07.206 --> 20:08.206
UH-HUH, OKAY, GREAT.
嗯嗯，好的，太好了。

20:08.310 --> 20:09.206
OKAY, YOU CAN GO RIGHT IN.
好的，您可以直接进去。

20:09.310 --> 20:10.137
- YOW!
- 哟！

20:12.586 --> 20:15.000
I'M READY FOR MY CLOSE-UP,
MR. DIRECTOR.
我准备好特写了，
先生。导演。

20:15.103 --> 20:16.655
- VERY WELL.
- 很好。

20:16.758 --> 20:18.413
LOSE THE PANTS!
脱掉裤子！

20:19.620 --> 20:20.517
[fabric rips]
[布料撕裂]

20:21.931 --> 20:23.586
HANS, WHERE'S MY STAR?
汉斯，我的星星在哪里？

20:26.793 --> 20:28.137
- WHAT'S HAPPENING?
- 发生了什么事？

20:28.241 --> 20:29.344
WH-WH-WHAT'S HAPPENING?
什-什-发生了什么事？

20:29.448 --> 20:30.896
- IN THIS SCENE,
- 在这个场景中，

20:31.000 --> 20:33.379
YOU WILL BE CLEANING
BATHROOM FIXTURES.
你将进行清洁工作
浴室设备。

20:33.482 --> 20:34.517
- OKAY.
- 好的。

20:34.620 --> 20:36.310
SO WHERE'S MY CLEANING UTENSIL?
那么我的清洁用具在哪里？

20:36.413 --> 20:37.275
- ACH, DU LIEBER.
- ACH，杜利伯。

20:37.379 --> 20:38.620
DON'T YOU GET IT?
你不明白吗？

20:38.724 --> 20:41.034
YOU ARE THE CLEANING UTENSIL.
您就是清洁用具。

20:41.137 --> 20:42.896
ROLL SPIED!
罗尔发现了！

20:43.000 --> 20:46.275
- NEW SPONGE COMMERCIAL,
TAKE ONE.
- 新海绵广告，
拿一个。

20:46.379 --> 20:47.586
- ACTION!
- 行动！

20:47.689 --> 20:49.000
- OH, NO.
- 哦，不。

20:49.103 --> 20:51.137
YOUR BATHROOM IS A DISASTER.
你的浴室简直就是一场灾难。

20:51.241 --> 20:54.586
GET IT CLEANED UP FAST
WITH THE NEW SPONGE.
快速清理干净
使用新海绵。

20:54.689 --> 20:56.586
- [whimpering]
- [呜咽]

20:56.689 --> 21:01.241
- HOUSEHOLD CHORES ARE A SNAP
WITH NEW SPONGE.
- 做家务是小菜一碟
带新海绵。

21:01.344 --> 21:03.137
IT CLEANS SINKS.
它可以清洁水槽。

21:03.241 --> 21:05.862
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

21:05.965 --> 21:08.310
JUST LOOK AT THAT SHINE!
看看那光芒！

21:08.413 --> 21:09.379
splat!
啪！

21:09.482 --> 21:10.965
NEW SPONGE CUTS THROUGH
新海绵切入

21:11.068 --> 21:13.827
EVEN THE TOUGHEST
GRIME AND GRIT.
即使是最艰难的
污垢和砂砾。

21:13.931 --> 21:17.862
NEW SPONGE ALSO CLEANS SHOWERS.
新海绵还可清洁淋浴。

21:17.965 --> 21:19.103
- WHOA!
- 哇！

21:19.206 --> 21:20.310
WHOA!
哇啊！

21:20.413 --> 21:21.827
WHOA, WHOA, WHOA, WHOA!
哇，哇，哇，哇！

21:21.931 --> 21:22.827
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

21:22.931 --> 21:24.379
THAT TILE LOOKS GOOD AS NEW.
那块瓷砖看起来就像新的一样。

21:24.482 --> 21:26.689
BUT BEST OF ALL,
但最重要的是，

21:26.793 --> 21:30.344
NEW SPONGE CAN MAKE
ANY TOILET SPARKLE.
新海绵可以制造
任何厕所都会闪闪发光。

21:30.448 --> 21:32.310
[farting noises]
[放屁声]

21:32.413 --> 21:35.931
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

21:36.034 --> 21:38.620
NO!
不！

21:38.724 --> 21:41.724
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

21:41.827 --> 21:43.172
I CAN'T DO THIS.
我不能这样做。

21:43.275 --> 21:44.517
- CUT!
- 切！

21:44.620 --> 21:46.586
- I'M SORRY.
- 对不起。

21:46.689 --> 21:48.793
I DON'T THINK I'M CUT OUT
FOR ACTING.
我不认为我被排除在外
为了表演。

21:48.896 --> 21:49.931
- WAS?
- 曾是？

21:50.034 --> 21:51.482
YOU SAID YOU ARE
PROFESSIONAL ACTOR.
你说你是
专业演员。

21:51.586 --> 21:53.379
- WELL, I'M NOT.
- 嗯，我不是。

21:53.482 --> 21:56.413
I AM A FRY COOK.
我是一名油炸厨师。

21:56.517 --> 21:57.862
THAT'S WHAT I AM,
这就是我，

21:57.965 --> 21:59.793
AND THAT'S WHAT
I'VE ALWAYS BEEN.
就是这样
我一直都是。

21:59.896 --> 22:01.896
I'M SORRY TO WASTE
YOUR TIME, MISTER.
我很抱歉浪费了
您的时间到了，先生。

22:02.000 --> 22:04.689
- WAIT, WAIT!
- 等等，等等！

22:07.586 --> 22:09.310
- EVER SO GENTLY.
- 非常温柔。

22:09.413 --> 22:10.896
- MR. KRABS!
- 先生。螃蟹！

22:13.586 --> 22:16.137
PLEASE TAKE ME BACK, PLEASE.
请带我回去，拜托。

22:16.241 --> 22:18.689
I PROMISE I'LL DO BETTER.
我保证我会做得更好。

22:18.793 --> 22:20.137
PLEASE.
请。

22:20.241 --> 22:23.344
- BOY, WHAT ARE YOU
GOING ON ABOUT?
- 男孩，你是谁
正在进行什么？

22:23.448 --> 22:25.137
- I HEARD YOU
ON THE PHONE SAYING
- 我听到你了
在电话里说

22:25.241 --> 22:27.310
YOU'RE GONNA LET
THE LITTLE GUY GO.
你会让
小家伙走吧。

22:27.413 --> 22:28.827
BUT I DON'T WANT TO GO.
但我不想去。

22:28.931 --> 22:30.482
PLEASE DON'T LET ME GO,
MR. KRABS!
请不要让我走，
先生。螃蟹！

22:30.586 --> 22:33.689
YOU'RE LOOKING AT A LITTLE GUY
THAT DOESN'T WANT TO GO!
你正在看着一个小家伙
那不想去！

22:33.793 --> 22:35.068
- ALL RIGHT, BOY-O.
- 好吧，男孩。

22:35.172 --> 22:36.068
I WON'T GET RID OF YOU
我不会摆脱你

22:36.172 --> 22:38.862
ON ONE CONDITION.
在一个条件下。

22:40.448 --> 22:42.758
- OH, BOY.
- 哦，男孩。

22:42.862 --> 22:44.310
THIS IS THE BEST JOB
IN THE WORLD.
这是最好的工作
在世界上。

22:44.413 --> 22:45.931
- HEY, WOULD YOU KEEP IT DOWN
IN THERE?
- 嘿，你能小声点吗
在那里？

22:46.034 --> 22:47.551
I'M TRYING TO CONCENTRATE.
我正在努力集中注意力。

